{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_07",
  "title": "亂局",
  "storyCode": "IW-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ca0a0c97b806a1132beca157b70cb4bdf93d29f95c3e0e2ce982461920bbcacc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "07上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......唔。\n頭疼頭疼......何事如此喧嘩......嗯？\n啊......原來是落子聲響，叮叮噹噹。\n棋罷不知人換世，夢醒只道是何年......何年......何年......\n呃......\n......怎麼酒又沒了。\n這都是何苦呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尚塚摸了摸脖子上的膏藥，這是他的習慣。\n十年如一日地挑起扁擔，上山下山，這也是他的習慣。\n取江峰確實很高，很險。高到沒有人煙，險到萬籟俱寂。\n數不清這是在尚蜀看見的第幾個春天，他抬頭遠眺，只見人蹤盡滅的山道那頭，有一個人。\n一個他等了很久的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我們終於還是再見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "方才見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那時你沒有帶刀，就不算見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "那現在我帶刀來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......話先說明了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我知道錯不在你。我也知道，那個雨夜，死的不止是我的兒子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你當然知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你收養了他的女兒，她現在怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......我打算讓她接我的班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是打算接鏢局的班，還是像你這些年做的，安安分分當個老闆娘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "都行，看她喜歡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "找到心上人沒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "沒呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你活不到看她出嫁的那天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......也許今天我們不用打打殺殺的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "不可能，我知道你的為人，你心裡有愧，但我心裡有怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "怨了十年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......所以呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以你一開始就沒打算今天贏我。酒樓茶館客棧，哪一個不都是為了給你的女兒留條退路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你知道鏢局是個得罪人的行當。你也知道，如果你不在了，鏢局會是什麼樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "別忘了，你掛刀而去，不守規矩，於情，大家體諒你，可於理，你還是個叛徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那夜之後，你若是背負著那些罪過，帶領鏢局繼續前行，我又怎麼會叛出鏢局！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我兒走鏢，也是有所覺悟的，我何嘗不知？可你的行為，開客棧開餐廳，難道不是踐踏他們的死嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是你！一蹶不振，逃避過去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "是啊......我是知道的，但咱們話說得有點多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "行裕鏢局總鏢頭，問霜客，鄭清鉞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......尚家棍，尚塚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "早春，垂暮，樹影婆娑，落雪如銀。\n一陣風起，一把刀落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你實在是歇息得太久了，鄭清鉞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......未必是我歇息得久了，也許是你爬山爬得太多，步法又精進了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "誰知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "可你這樣的英雄好漢，下半輩子卻註定無法行走，也實在可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......只是刀勢太快，雪光晃眼，被你稍微擦破褲腿，我就無法行走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "下一刀，你擋不住。你拿的，畢竟不是家傳的寶棍。只是根破木棍罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——爹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "夜兒！？你怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你果然是杜遙夜。轉眼間，已經長這麼大了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "二位好閒情，天色漸晚，還有空在這......比武練習。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是你。你在這裡做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不瞞尚師傅你說，你腰間那隻盞，是我一朋友托我尋來的。我要找亭子，也和那隻酒盞分不開呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我怕刀劍無眼，二位切磋之間......誤碰了酒盞，得不償失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹，你這是在做什麼——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......夜兒，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "十年前，行裕鏢局接了一單大鏢。但是路上遭遇暴雨，在荒野上被土匪襲擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "為了保貨，鄭清鉞放棄了同行的鏢師，十幾個弟兄死於非命，其中有我的兒子，也有你的......親生父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "鄭清鉞見死不救。他不僅見死不救，到頭來，他也沒把貨物保住，沒把鏢局名聲保住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "甚至再後來，他對鏢局之落魄視而不見，逃避失敗，你知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "在那之後，你的母親也離開了尚蜀，回了老家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "杜遙夜......這些，你當真知道嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "夜兒。這沒你的事，爹這就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你就是......尚師傅吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "是叛徒尚塚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你以為本小姐是什麼人？一無所知地像個傻子一樣在溫室裡長大到今天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "啊，我親爹親娘的事情，我都知道。鄭老頭這些年做了什麼，怎麼做的，我比你更清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "所以，今天我便是要告訴你們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——鏢局也好酒館也罷，遲早是要姓杜的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "麻煩二老，不要現在給我找麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你要是不讓開，是要吃苦頭的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有話好好說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......銅錢劍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "笑話。難道你要在我面前賣弄什麼術法不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "欸，免了免了，我可不是擅長近身戰鬥的人......只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "這玩意，你要便拿去，接著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "——休想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "鄭清鉞！你還敢分神！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——別對爹出手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "唔，礙事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "夜兒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "尚塚，你這老糊塗，竟然對晚輩動手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "叮的一聲。\n扁擔一撇，壓下刀光，可鄭清鉞的刀，卻不可避地偏向了別處。\n而那酒盞又實在是堅硬，若非如此，天底下有什麼瓷器，是挨了鄭清鉞一刀還能完好無損的？\n可是這一刀，卻把那隻漆黑如夜的酒盞，打飛了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "——酒盞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "別管我們！忙你的去吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "可你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "這是家務事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "堅持一小會，馬上就有人來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "夜兒，不能讓他去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "這老匹夫想要你命啊，你還要管那破玩意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "杜遙夜說得對。十年前，你也是從山崖上弄丟了這隻酒盞。如今，再來一次，滋味如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "尚塚......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "要我讓開，辦法簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "到此為止！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "鄭前輩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "——酒盞被擊落山崖，那個龍門人已經去找了，二位，動作快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "感謝前輩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "太合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......杜小姐這是做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你不能去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......為何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......梁大人和姓鯉的，還有兩位看著就不近人情的朝廷特使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "總要選邊站的，我想通了而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "再說，我答應過姓鯉的了， 江湖人一諾千金，也是規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "夜兒！別胡鬧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......人真多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "今天本不該來這麼多人。但是，無妨......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "做個了斷，有你我就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "——嘖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "杜小姐，你應該知道我們是秉公辦事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我看未必有那麼“秉公”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "請讓開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "那就失禮了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "且慢且慢，這麼一個大老爺們，就這麼對一個姑娘家出手，不好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "——廉家陰晴扇，果然好功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不識抬舉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子，沒事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "呃，疼疼疼，竟然能把這麼大塊石磚隨手拋出......真是可怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "敬酒不吃吃罰酒，無話可說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "弩箭！是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我在這裡喲。看錯方向啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "不要礙事，兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "羅德島是不打算協助司歲台了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不打算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你們也許有你們的道理。但是年和我們相處了很久，我清楚她的為人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "獸心難測，為人又算的了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "也許算不了什麼，但起碼要算個我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "還有我。夕小姐點破迷障，也算給了我一記當頭棒喝......我這人稍微有點喜歡躲事，不過好就好在，我還是知恩圖報的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......廉家陰晴扇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "上次被你嚇著了，不敢動手，這次倒是有機會領教領教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你們要搶你們的盞，就滾一邊去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "這隻酒盞對鏢局意義重大，要是就這麼擱置一旁，我和死了有什麼區別？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你現在本就和死了沒什麼區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好好好，現在你的眼神才像鄭清鉞的眼神，是因為女兒在這兒，還是因為鏢局顏面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你總算是一個想活下去的人了，這樣我們的勝負才有意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......尚塚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "若是你的兒子在天之靈，知道你今天如此作為，他會高興嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "別拿那套話來誆我，他就是活著，站在這兒，他也攔不住他老子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......慎師傅，為何在此？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "把那幾人送到山頂，我就下山了。想著遲早會遇到梁大人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "梁大人不也果真來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "過了許久了，我來近處看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "那寧小姐那邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "察覺到了，或許一早就察覺到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "書房失竊，多半是她的小心思吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......還請梁大人勸勸寧小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "其他幾位先不提，那位姓白的老陶工，絕對不能出手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "白天師......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "他攥一把天雷灑向人間，就等同司歲台和禮部撕破了臉皮，天師府的一雙腳，也不知道站哪兒好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有勞慎師傅操心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉......我就是個船夫，操什麼心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "以前戍守過幾年北疆，天寒地凍沒事幹，就和袍澤弟兄扯些家國大事，聊著玩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "既然大家都是一心向炎，不過些許小事上差之毫釐，大沒有必要失之千里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "此乃匹夫之責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我是匹夫，梁大人也算匹夫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "大地厚廣，萬物自由。普天之下，皆為匹夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉......梁大人希望我怎麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "希望慎師傅保尚蜀太平。如果最後出了什麼岔子......希望慎師傅搶在寧小姐和那五人有所行動之前，先一步息事寧人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "有句老話叫作盡人事以待天命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某人從大炎朝堂之上學來的第一句話，便是“天命在人”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
